Frontend
    - account login for each member
    - different modes: software/hardware (request parts), buisness (edit each part and accept requests)
    - software/hardware:
        - receipt of a bunch of items
        - textbox with extra requests
        - send request
    - buisness:
        - look at and accept requests
        - edit entire the inventory

Backend
    - audit log, for who took what
    - hook up inv.json to google sheets